  m_Name: VARK 01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Questionnaire.VARKQSO
  question: 'I want to learn about a new project. I would ask for:'
  optionA: Diagrams to show the project stages with charts of benefits and costs.
  optionB: An opportunity to discuss the project.
  optionC: A written report describing the main features of the project.
  optionD: Examples where the project has been used successfully.
